  "instructions": [
    "Cut the savoy cabbage into thin wedges and separate the leaves.",
    "Mince the onion and garlic.",
    "Heat the olive oil in the hot pot vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the caraway seeds and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the apple cider vinegar and lemon juice, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the water, potassium chloride, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Place the hot pot vessel in a bain-marie and steam the cabbage for 20-25 minutes, or until tender.",
    "Remove the cabbage from the steamer and serve hot, garnished with bay leaves if desired."
